# Byte-stable / binary assets: never line-ending-normalize (core.autocrlf=true on Windows would otherwise depend
# on each contributor's git config). public/assets/** -text also keeps the extractor's JSON outputs byte-stable
# across clones (the committed-asset integrity test depends on exact bytes).
public/assets/** -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.swf binary
*.exe binary
